      "cooked": "<p>I really like cute animals - pets, wild, whatever - and this has been a tough year in a lot of ways, but also I moved to an area with a lot of very nice birds so that has taken the edge off a tiny bit.</p>\n<p>Anyway, if you want to share a photo of your pet or some wildlife near you, I would be delighted.</p>\n<p>This one is a magpie (the Australian kind, not the European kind) that decided to perch on my washing line to inspect my back garden.</p>",
